Usage: /usr/bin/../libexec/ro-assist/ro-assist [options]
Fedora KDE desktop assistant for system maintenance

Options:
  -h, --help       Displays help on commandline options.
  --help-all       Displays help, including generic Qt options.
  -v, --version    Displays version information.
  --autostart      Launch from the desktop autostart entry.
  --smoke-test     Create the UI and exit immediately.
  --reset-welcome  Show the first-run welcome flow again on the next launch.
